;[Tips.アローσ@Path_S]
;effect.name=Draws a line along the path and places arrowhead shapes at the ends.
;曲線精度=Maximum sampling interval for polyline approximation, in pixels
;開始位置=Start point of the line drawing range, in % of total path length
;終了位置=End point of the line drawing range, in % of total path length
;破線パターン=Write lengths of solid and blank segments alternately, in pixels
;矢じり幅=Scaling rate of arrowhead width (percentage)
;ランダム周期=Period along the path direction of random variation, in pixels
;ランダム振幅=Magnitude of random variation, in pixels
;ランダム固定端=Excludes the path start and end from random variation.
;ランダムシード=If positive, the same seed yields different randomness for different objects.\nIf negative, the same seed yields identical randomness across objects.

